{"id":2316,"date":"2024-09-19T12:34:35","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:34:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2316"},"modified":"2025-10-02T09:48:18","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T09:48:18","slug":"cardboard-pizza-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-pizza-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Pizza Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Where to Buy Cardboard Pizza Boxes in Bulk or Small Quantities<\/h2>\n<p>We at <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a> offer high-quality cardboard pizza boxes made to fit the demands of pizzerias, cafes, delivery outlets, and food trucks. These boxes are designed to preserve freshness, prevent moisture buildup, and protect your pizza from the oven to the customer\u2019s doorstep.<\/p>\n<p>Whether you\u2019re searching for where to buy cardboard pizza boxes in small or large quantities, we deliver custom-made solutions that match your needs. From rectangle pizza boxes to square shapes, we provide all sizes with durable locking systems and printing options.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Strong and Fresh Pizza Box Packaging Solutions<\/h2>\n<h3>Designed to Keep Pizzas Safe and Warm<\/h3>\n<p>Our pizza box packaging is built using food-safe, recyclable material. Each box is manufactured with fluted cardboard that provides insulation, strength, and rigidity. This ensures that your pizza retains heat and shape during transit or display.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Keeps the pizza warm for longer delivery windows<\/li>\n<li>Grease-resistant surface to avoid leaks and stains<\/li>\n<li>Stackable design for bulk handling and storage<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re offering personal-sized slices or jumbo family pizzas, we offer large cardboard pizza boxes and compact options to match your menu.<\/p>\n<h3>Available in Different Shapes and Sizes<\/h3>\n<p>We provide rectangle pizza boxes, square boxes, and die-cut shapes for various pizza styles.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Standard sizes: 7&#8243;, 9&#8243;, 12&#8243;, 14&#8243;, 16&#8243;, 18&#8243;, and more<\/li>\n<li>Custom sizes based on your pizza dimensions<\/li>\n<li>Box depths can be adjusted for thin crust or deep dish<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>All boxes are delivered flat-packed to save space and are easy to assemble when needed.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Cardboard Pizza Boxes<\/h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Specification<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Dimensions<\/td>\n<td>7\u201d to 20\u201d (Custom sizes also available)<\/td>\n<td>White SBS, Brown Kraft, Corrugated Board<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>Personal pizzas, family pizzas, event servings<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Depths<\/td>\n<td>Adjustable from 1.5\u201d to 3.5\u201d<\/td>\n<td>Food-grade cardboard<\/td>\n<td>Smooth Matte or Gloss coating<\/td>\n<td>Thin crust, deep dish, cheesy crust<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shapes<\/td>\n<td>Square, Rectangle, Die-Cut, Custom<\/td>\n<td>Eco Kraft, Coated Board<\/td>\n<td>Embossing, Foil Stamping<\/td>\n<td>Neapolitan, Sicilian, Detroit-style pizzas<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Assembly<\/td>\n<td>Flat-packed, easy to fold<\/td>\n<td>Fluted Cardboard<\/td>\n<td>Optional grease barrier<\/td>\n<td>Restaurants, cafes, takeaway outlets<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Cardboard Pizza Boxes Empty and Ready to Use<\/h2>\n<h3>Multiple Uses Beyond Fresh Pizza Packaging<\/h3>\n<p>We also supply <strong>cardboard pizza boxes empty<\/strong>, giving food entrepreneurs the flexibility to use them for more than pizza. These boxes are used for:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Baked goods like cookies and brownies<\/li>\n<li>Flatbread and garlic bread packaging<\/li>\n<li>Frozen pizza shipping<\/li>\n<li>DIY food kits and events<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>You can request plain, unprinted boxes or add branding for retail shelves or delivery orders.<\/p>\n<h3>Available Plain or Fully Customized<\/h3>\n<p>If you need pizza boxes for sale without any artwork, we\u2019ve got those too. Unprinted boxes help save cost while giving you the option to label or stamp your brand manually.<\/p>\n<p>For branding needs, our boxes can be printed with:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Full-color logos or single-color prints<\/li>\n<li>Ingredient or allergen information<\/li>\n<li>Promotional graphics or coupon codes<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>We also offer inside printing if you\u2019d like to surprise customers with messages or QR codes.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Order Cardboard Pizza Boxes Wholesale<\/h2>\n<h3>Bulk Packaging with Lower Costs<\/h3>\n<p>Ordering <strong>cardboard pizza boxes wholesale<\/strong> allows you to manage your packaging needs efficiently, especially during high-demand seasons or events.<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Reduced per-unit price on larger orders<\/li>\n<li>Consistent supply to avoid packaging shortages<\/li>\n<li>Easier planning for inventory and storage<\/li>\n<li>Stronger negotiating power on repeat orders<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>We provide competitive wholesale rates on <strong>cardboard pizza boxes for sale<\/strong> whether you run a local pizza shop or supply across multiple branches.<\/p>\n<h3>Perfect for Restaurants, Cafes, and Events<\/h3>\n<p>Our boxes are used by small pizza outlets, food festivals, pop-ups, and chains nationwide. Whether you need branding support or fast reorders, our production workflow ensures timely delivery.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<p data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"219\"><strong data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"219\">Need More Packaging for Other Food Items?<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"563\">If your food business includes burgers, wraps, or grilled items in addition to pizza, consider using our <strong data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"418\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-burger-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"416\">Cardboard Burger Boxes<\/a><\/strong>. These boxes are designed to keep food warm, maintain structure during transit, and offer easy branding options for dine-in or delivery service.<\/p>\n<h2>Coating and Printing Options for Better Presentation<\/h2>\n<h3>Finishing Choices for a Professional Look<\/h3>\n<p>You can enhance the appearance and durability of your boxes with high-quality coatings:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gloss coating for shine and brand appeal<\/li>\n<li>Matte finish for a smooth, non-reflective surface<\/li>\n<li>Spot UV to highlight logo areas or designs<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>We also offer food-safe inks and coatings for boxes that come into direct contact with pizza or other edibles.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Printing &amp; Coating Options<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Specification<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing<\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, 1\u20132 Color, Full-Top Print<\/td>\n<td>Gloss\/Matte Coated Cardboard<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>QR Codes, Coupon Codes, Brand Logos<\/td>\n<td>Delivery, Takeaway, Retail Branding<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coating<\/td>\n<td>Protective Food-Safe Layer<\/td>\n<td>Eco-Friendly Kraft<\/td>\n<td>Soft Touch, Anti-Scratch<\/td>\n<td>Inside Printing Option<\/td>\n<td>Pizza delivery, shelf display<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Branding<\/td>\n<td>Full-color &amp; Single-color<\/td>\n<td>SBS, Kraft, Corrugated<\/td>\n<td>Foil Stamping, Embossing<\/td>\n<td>Custom Message or Logo Inside<\/td>\n<td>Events, Chains, Promotions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3>Custom Printing for Effective Branding<\/h3>\n<p>Printed pizza boxes serve as walking advertisements for your brand. With clear, bold printing, your name stays visible wherever the pizza goes.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>One-color prints for basic designs<\/li>\n<li>Full-top color printing for bold branding<\/li>\n<li>Foil stamping available for premium touches<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Ask us about our printing guidelines or get assistance from our design team at no extra cost.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Easy Steps to Place Your Order<\/h2>\n<h3>Get Started in Minutes<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Choose your box size and shape<\/li>\n<li>Share your artwork or request help from our team<\/li>\n<li>Select printing and coating options<\/li>\n<li>Approve your proof<\/li>\n<li>Receive your boxes with free nationwide shipping<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>All our boxes are food-safe, strong, and built for performance.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<p data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"338\"><strong data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"338\">Related Food Packaging Options You Might Like<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"666\">Explore more packaging formats through our <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/food-related-cardboard-boxes\/\"><strong data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"415\">Food-Related Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a> collection. This category includes options designed for food safety, portion control, and on-the-go convenience. Many customers use these boxes alongside our pizza packaging to create consistent brand presentation for sides, desserts, or combo meals.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"666\"><strong>Easy Steps to Place Your Order<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Step<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Action<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Support Available<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>1<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Choose Box Size &amp; Shape<\/td>\n<td>Select from standard sizes (7\u201d\u201320\u201d) or request custom dimensions<\/td>\n<td>Free guidance on box dimensions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>2<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Share Artwork<\/td>\n<td>Upload your logo or design, or request design help<\/td>\n<td>Free professional design assistance<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>3<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Select Printing &amp; Coating<\/td>\n<td>Options include Gloss, Matte, Spot UV, Foil Stamping<\/td>\n<td>Food-safe inks and coatings available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>4<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Approve Proof<\/td>\n<td>Get 3D mockups, flat views, or samples before production<\/td>\n<td>Revisions included until approved<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>5<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Receive Boxes<\/td>\n<td>Delivered flat-packed, with free nationwide shipping<\/td>\n<td>Rush delivery options available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Choose Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom sizes for small and large pizzas<\/li>\n<li>Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV coating options<\/li>\n<li>Free design help and digital mock-ups<\/li>\n<li>Fast turnaround with rush production available<\/li>\n<li>Durable cardboard with grease resistance<\/li>\n<li>Free nationwide shipping<\/li>\n<li>Competitive wholesale pricing<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re searching for where to buy cardboard pizza boxes, need rectangle pizza boxes, or want cardboard pizza boxes empty, we&#8217;re ready to support your packaging goals.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes for premium cardboard pizza boxes at wholesale prices. We provide custom sizes and styles to fit your needs, using premium materials and vibrant printing options. Plus, you can choose from coating options like Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV for a polished finish. Get started today for a hassle-free experience!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2442,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[183],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2316","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat